next_edit_score — the daemon's pipeline, an arbitrary model
  listening    http://127.0.0.1:9799/v1/edit_predictions
  upstream     http://127.0.0.1:8089
  format       zeta2
  model_id     zeta-2
  concurrency  1 (queued, never refused — no `busy` drops)
  timeout      15000 ms

  score it:  python3 scripts/next_edit_gen_eval.py --endpoint http://127.0.0.1:9799
